<!--
  D176 per-cause: "Provisional Mortality Statistics, 2018 through Last Month",
  grouped by Year x UCD ICD-10 113 Cause List. Built from the working
  year-only mortality_provisional.xml with three edits confirmed from the
  D176 request form:
    B_2    *None*    -> D176.V4   (Group Results By = 113 Cause List)
    O_ucd  D176.V2   -> D176.V4   (Step 6 radio - the "button" the
                                   earlier attempts were missing)
    O_aar  aar_none  -> aar_std + O_aar_enable=true  (age-adjusted rate)
  {{YEAR_LIST}} + O_PR=false + O_show_totals=false carried over unchanged.
  Response cells: year, cause(label incl #, h=depth), Deaths, Population,
  Crude Rate, Age-Adjusted Rate -> same 6-col contract as the icd10 era.
  Test: node --env-file=.env fetch.js --type=mortality --era=provisional_causes --years=2021 --out=rows.json --dump
